# F6-33 Worked example: per-element counts taken from the SOURCE of roofline.cu
# (2 FLOP per multiply-add, 4 bytes per float read or written), before reading SASS.
kernel saxpy-source flops 2 bytes 12
kernel poly1-source flops 2 bytes 8
kernel poly4-source flops 8 bytes 8
kernel poly16-source flops 32 bytes 8
kernel poly64-source flops 128 bytes 8
kernel poly256-source flops 512 bytes 8
